WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:06.042
Once more, Swallow felt proud after his good deed.

2
00:00:06.043 --> 00:00:09.916
And once more, he was ready to go.

3
00:00:09.917 --> 00:00:13.296
He searched the docks for the ship to Egypt.

4
00:00:13.297 --> 00:00:17.457
He didn't need to follow it—he knew the way.

5
00:00:17.458 --> 00:00:23.041
But traveling alone seemed lonely and tiring.

6
00:00:23.042 --> 00:00:27.540
Swallow spotted the ship and started to dive down.

7
00:00:27.541 --> 00:00:32.124
But a hawk was circling overhead.

8
00:00:32.125 --> 00:00:36.916
It was the same one that Swallow had seen yesterday.

9
00:00:36.917 --> 00:00:40.332
"If I land, it will catch me!"

10
00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:45.624
As Swallow shot away, he saw someone familiar below.

11
00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:50.269
The girl who was selling eggs now stood outside a building.

12
00:00:50.270 --> 00:00:52.916
She was with other children.

13
00:00:52.917 --> 00:00:56.504
Swallow perched in a tree to watch.

14
00:00:56.505 --> 00:01:03.163
The girl showed the jewel to the others. "We'll never go hungry again!"

15
00:01:03.164 --> 00:01:07.207
The children cheered.

16
00:01:07.208 --> 00:01:14.582
Swallow's heart swelled. "I must tell Prince about this before leaving!"

17
00:01:14.583 --> 00:01:20.333
But when Swallow reached the statue, he saw a crowd.

18
00:01:20.334 --> 00:01:25.916
Some people looked sad, others angry.

19
00:01:25.917 --> 00:01:31.124
"Our beautiful statue is ruined!" a woman cried.

20
00:01:31.125 --> 00:01:35.249
"Two of its jewels are gone!"

21
00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:45.082
"We must find the thief!" a man shouted. "Our Happy Prince is turning ugly."

22
00:01:45.083 --> 00:01:50.719
"Ugly?" Swallow scowled. "That's not nice!

23
00:01:50.720 --> 00:02:01.082
And his beauty shines—in all his generous deeds. You people should thank him!"

24
00:02:01.083 --> 00:02:06.519
Only the statue heard Swallow's words. "It's okay, Swallow.

25
00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:11.332
I don't need thanks. It's the right thing to do.

26
00:02:11.333 --> 00:02:15.623
Tell me, why have you returned?"

27
00:02:15.624 --> 00:02:22.072
"I came to tell you how happy the orphans are," Swallow said.

28
00:02:22.073 --> 00:02:25.714
"That's wonderful," said the statue.

29
00:02:25.715 --> 00:02:29.707
"My heart feels a bit lighter now.

30
00:02:29.708 --> 00:02:35.160
But you'd better leave for Egypt. A storm is coming."

31
00:02:35.161 --> 00:02:42.749
Swallow looked up. The sky was gray, and it started to rain.

32
00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:46.358
"I was planning to fly to Egypt with a ship.

33
00:02:46.359 --> 00:02:54.374
But it won't sail in this weather. I'll stay one more night."

34
00:02:54.375 --> 00:02:58.730
He curled up in the warm spot between the statue's feet.

35
00:02:58.731 --> 00:03:05.150
But he couldn't sleep. He had an idea.

36
00:03:05.151 --> 00:03:10.874
Later, after the storm, Swallow flew to the statue's shoulder.

37
00:03:10.875 --> 00:03:13.647
"You have one jewel left.

38
00:03:13.648 --> 00:03:17.693
Before I go, let me take it to someone in need."

39
00:03:17.694 --> 00:03:28.874
"Yes," said the statue. "Take it to the three children who live under the bridge."

40
00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:35.332
Swallow plucked the sapphire and flew toward the bridge.

41
00:03:35.333 --> 00:03:39.666
He passed many people who needed help.

42
00:03:39.667 --> 00:03:44.749
"I wish I could help everyone," he thought.

43
00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:49.063
Swallow found the three children huddled under the bridge.

44
00:03:49.064 --> 00:03:54.041
They were thin and cold, with no blankets or coats.

45
00:03:54.042 --> 00:03:59.124
Swoosh! He dropped the jewel in their pot.

46
00:03:59.125 --> 00:04:03.327
As he flew off, he heard them shout.

47
00:04:03.328 --> 00:04:07.166
"Was that a bird?" the boy cried.

48
00:04:07.167 --> 00:04:12.999
"Yes, and it gave us a jewel!" his sister said.

49
00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:16.095
"Now we can buy clothing!"

50
00:04:16.096 --> 00:04:26.062
"And food!" the littlest one shouted.

